      "options": {},
      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Glitch cuts the picture into blocks, shoves some sideways and pulls red and blue apart along the shove, like a broken video signal. Its Step picks the pattern: the Master Gear's Wrapped, times 8 and rounded down, gives a new break eight times a loop. Turn Intensity and RGB Split, or type another word into the Text."
        }
      },
